{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27295602","formula":"C₄₄H₅₉GaN₆O₁₇","hill":"C44H59GaN6O17","elements":["H","C","N","O","Ga"],"composition":{"C":44.0,"H":59.0,"N":6.0,"O":17.0,"Ga":1.0},"names":{"en":"Gallium 68 PSMA-11"},"descriptions":{"en":"Gallium (68Ga) gozetotide or Gallium (68Ga) PSMA-11, is a radiopharmaceutical made of 68Ga conjugated to a inhibitor of the enzyme prostate-specific membrane antigen (PSMA) known as Glu-Urea-Lys(Ahx)-HBED-CC. It is used for imaging prostate cancer by positron emission tomography (PET). The PSMA inhibitor specifically directs the radiolabeled imaging agent towards the prostate cancerous lesions in men. The most common side effects with gallium (68Ga)-radiolabelled gozetotide are tiredness, nausea (feeling sick), constipation and vomiting."},"fame":5,"pubchemCid":91800164,"mass":1011.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC(=C(C=C1CCC(=O)NCCCCCC(=O)NCCCC[C@@H](C(=O)O)NC(=O)N[C@@H](CCC(=O)O)C(=O)O)CN(CCN(CC2=C(C=CC(=C2)CCC(=O)[O-])O)CC(=O)[O-])CC(=O)[O-])O.[68Ga+3]","inchikey":"AEBYHKKMCWUMKX-LNTZDJBBSA-K","iupac":"3-[3-[[2-[[5-[3-[[6-[[(5S)-5-carboxy-5-[[(1S)-1,3-dicarboxypropyl]carbamoylamino]pentyl]amino]-6-oxohexyl]amino]-3-oxopropyl]-2-hydroxyphenyl]methyl-(carboxylatomethyl)amino]ethyl-(carboxylatomethyl)amino]methyl]-4-hydroxyphenyl]propanoate;gallium-68(3+)","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"91800164","atoms":127,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.04,"y":-2.865,"z":2.882,"el":"C"},{"x":0.699,"y":-2.354,"z":1.765,"el":"C"},{"x":0.359,"y":-1.102,"z":1.248,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.698,"y":-0.366,"z":1.794,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.351,"y":-0.898,"z":2.922,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.966,"y":-2.119,"z":3.5,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.618,"y":-2.554,"z":4.792,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.646,"y":-2.949,"z":5.907,"el":"C"},{"x":0.192,"y":-1.864,"z":6.